    use: 'No exit rescues the 4h-slope entry: holding while the slope holds, trailing the prior day, N-day time stops and half-at-1R all reshape the payoff, not the mean. The desk keeps a 21:00 close; pages and bots must not say the bias should be "held" or name a better exit. Exits are only worth retesting on an entry with demonstrated drift.',
