    claim: 'Futures discovery (post-hoc): Jordan HL moving projection P90, inside touch 07-10 London, continues 61.3 pct vs rejects 36.1 pct (placebo 45.6/49.3), follow gross +0.25R net +0.10R (n 380). Replicates on 22 CFDs not in the futures set (crosses, PALLADIUM, UK100): R1 cont-rej vs placebo > 0, R2 follow gross > 0, R3 follow gross vs placebo > 0',
