    result: 'Pre-registered; level-context-engine touch events, 25 futures net 2.5 ticks + 40 CFDs gross, trade years 2022-2026.08. S1 -0.031R [-0.052, -0.009] (5,413 trades, 95 cells; halves -0.013/-0.045) NULL; S2 line - placebo engine -0.015R [-0.046, +0.013] NULL. Every-touch fade -0.151R / follow -0.130R net; selection = cost avoidance (gross +0.004R), NQ 47 pct of trades. CFDs gross: selected +0.011R [+0.008, +0.015] but placebo engine +0.014R (line - placebo -0.002 [-0.007, +0.002]). History picks next year winning side 54 pct (57 pct selected cells), same at placebo. Follow chosen 2:1 (Close+ follow leads). Variants (rolling 2y, t>0/2, n 30/100, no bucket) all null vs placebo. Selected NQ/GC mae60 median 150/38 ticks vs every touch 160/44 vs Jordan 114/34; unchanged in sigma. Graded weight: against history-selected level trading as an edge.',
