    claim: 'The owner fixed-sigma VWAP indicator (hlc3 VWAP, median 20-session RMS sigma) used for targets makes Jordan lines tradeable: fade a Close+/- or HL-projection touch at or beyond +-2 sigma_v with TP at the +-1 sigma_v band (C1) or VWAP (C2); secondary D the +-2 sigma re-entry signal',
